# Byte-exactness matters in this repository.
#
# `sdcard/sysprompt/*.txt` is the prompt sent to the model verbatim, and the
# API's prefix cache depends on it being byte-identical from run to run and
# from machine to machine. `sdcard/web/index.html` and the SD-card config are
# the same kind of artifact.
#
# With `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) the working tree would carry
# CRLF while the repository carries LF, so a clone on Linux would build a
# subtly different prompt. Force LF everywhere instead: every editor and the
# toolchain handle it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise content that is not text.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.bin   binary
*.elf   binary
